---
const steps = [
  {
    n: '01',
    label: 'Index',
    title: 'Read the repo like a senior engineer would.',
    body:
      'The indexer walks the tree, builds a RepoManifest, and detects the harness. The convention learner fills in the missing context: how this team writes code.',
    badge: 'seconds',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    label: 'Plan',
    title: 'A checkpointed plan you can approve or reject.',
    body:
      'The planner produces 3–8 steps with success conditions. Impact analysis and a security scan run in parallel. Nothing is edited until you sign off.',
    badge: 'review',
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    label: 'Edit',
    title: 'Semantic edits in the codebase’s dialect.',
    body:
      'The coder swarm edits files, runs the test loop, and stays within the sandbox policy. Cross-file refactors follow the call graph, not vibes.',
    badge: 'iterate',
  },
  {
    n: '04',
    label: 'Verify',
    title: 'Four gates before anything is a PR.',
    body:
      'typecheck + lint + test + build. If any one fails, the swarm retries with the verifier’s feedback. No green-on-paper PRs.',
    badge: 'strict',
  },
  {
    n: '05',
    label: 'Ship',
    title: 'Branch, commit, draft PR — all wired.',
    body:
      'Conventional Commits, a magic/<date>-<slug> branch, and a structured PR description with the reporter’s summary. Respects git_policy end to end.',
    badge: 'draft',
  },
];
---

<section id="workflow" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="glow-orb left-1/2 top-1/3 h-[480px] w-[680px] -translate-x-1/2 bg-accent-violet/15"></div>

  <div class="container-page relative">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-14 md:gap-20 lg:grid-cols-[420px_1fr]">
      <!-- Left: section header, sticky -->
      <div class="reveal lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start">
        <p class="eyebrow">
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          How it works
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-display-sm font-semibold tracking-tightest text-balance text-white">
          From a sentence to a draft PR.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-balance text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">
          The agent graph runs as a single composable pipeline. You stay in control of the moments that matter; the
          rest is autonomous.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.02] p-5 lg:block">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-2xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/40">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber"></span>
            Live topology
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-white/65">
            Every run reuses the same five-stage pipeline. Cyclic retry on verifier failure; approval before plan, diff,
            or destructive ops.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: steps -->
      <ol class="reveal-stagger relative space-y-5">
        <!-- timeline rail -->
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[26px] top-3 bottom-3 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/0 via-white/12 to-white/0"></div>

        {steps.map((step) => (
          <li class="relative grid grid-cols-[56px_1fr] gap-3">
            <div class="relative">
              <div class="flex h-[52px] w-[52px] items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-900 text-white">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/55">{step.n}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.02] p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/15 hover:bg-white/[0.035]">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/45">{step.n}</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/45">·</span>
                <span class="font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">{step.title.split('.')[0]}</span>
                <span class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55">
                  {step.badge}
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/65">{step.body}</p>
              <div class="mt-5 text-xs text-white/40">
                <span class="font-mono">→</span> <span class="text-white/65">{step.label}</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>